&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;4&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
 &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The development has failed to
     demonstrate appropriate access for fire tenders and in the absence of a
     sufficient Fire Statement demonstrating how the safety of building users
     would be met, identifying suitably positioned unobstructed outside space
     for fire appliances and an evacuation assembly point, and how the proposed
     building would achieve the highest standards of fire safety, the
     development would be contrary to Policy D12 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;4&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;3&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
 &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The development fails to
     adequately demonstrate suitable arrangements for the collection and/or
     movement of bins to and from an appropriate collection point with suitable
     access for the Council’s waste contractors. The development has also
     failed to adequately demonstrate appropriate and functional servicing
     arrangements and therefore fails to achieve a satisfactory form of
     development, contrary to Policies DM1 and DM45 of the Harrow Develop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;ment
     Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;3&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
